If multiple alliances have the same type, then the alliance with the smallest alliance number is selected.  }{\insrsid13769774 Then, information on that alliance is listed.  In addi
tion, for those dyad-years where the members of the dyad are jointly in multiple alliances, a count of the number of separate alliances }{\insrsid3960424 of which both are members }{\insrsid13769774 has been computed.  
